  "description": "Braintree adapter: webhook notification signature verification and canonical event mapping.\n      Like VKSubscription.Provider.Stripe/.Paddle, implemented with only BCL/ASP.NET Core\n      shared-framework APIs (System.Security.Cryptography, System.Xml.Linq, Microsoft.AspNetCore.\n      WebUtilities for form parsing) - no Braintree SDK dependency - zero NuGet access required.\n      Verifies the classic bt_signature/bt_payload form-post mechanism (HMAC-SHA1 of SHA1(private\n      key), see BraintreeBillingProviderAdapter's doc comment for the source) and decodes the\n      base64/XML bt_payload into a canonical event.",
